t-d558089 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d558089\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"203\" src=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/img-gasket-sheets1-300x203.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-1340\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/img-gasket-sheets1-300x203.jpg 300w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/img-gasket-sheets1.jpg 518w\" sizes=\"100vw\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eafc9e3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"eafc9e3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-536e8d7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"536e8d7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3799722 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3799722\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Grafitli ve klingrit contalar</strong>, boru hatları, flanş bağlantıları, vanalar ve endüstriyel ekipmanlarda <strong>yüksek sıcaklık, yüksek basınç ve agresif kimyasallara karşı sızdırmazlık</strong> sağlamak için kullanılan kritik contalama çözümleridir. Bu contalar; özel grafik alaşımlı malzemeler ve elyaf takviyeli bileşimlerle imal edilir ve zorlu proseslerde güvenilir performans sunar.</p><p>Grafitli contalar, saf veya takviyeli grafit malzemeden üretilir ve özellikle yüksek ısı, buhar, yağ, su ve gaz uygulamalarında tercih edilir. Bu yapı, malzemeye hem <strong>yüksek kimyasal dayanım</strong> hem de <strong>sıcaklık toleransı</strong> kazandırır.</p><p>Klingrit contalar ise genellikle grafit veya elyaf bazlı karışımların preslenmesiyle oluşur ve asbestsiz seçeneklerle endüstriyel standartlarda sızdırmazlık sağlar.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad13b58 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ad13b58\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05c3a71 elementor-view-stacked elementor-position-inline-start elementor-tablet-position-inline-end elementor-shape-circle elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"05c3a71\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-table\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M464 32H48C21.49 32 0 53.49 0 80v352c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h416c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V80c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zM224 416H64v-96h160v96zm0-160H64v-96h160v96zm224 160H288v-96h160v96zm0-160H288v-96h160v96z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGrafitli &amp; Klingrit Conta – Teknik Değerler\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cef3d8f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cef3d8f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"514\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"185\">Özellik</td><td width=\"329\">Değer</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Ürün Tipi</td><td width=\"329\">Grafitli / Klingrit Conta</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Malzeme</td><td width=\"329\">Grafit + Elyaf / Metal Takviyeli Grafit</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Uygulama</td><td width=\"329\">Boru, flanş, vana ve mekanik bağlantı sızdırmazlığı</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Sıcaklık Aralığı</td><td width=\"329\">-200°C – +450°C (model &amp; malzemeye göre)</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Maksimum Basınç</td><td width=\"329\">≤ 100–160 bar (malzemeye göre değişir)</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Kimyasal Direnç</td><td width=\"329\">Su, yağ, gaz, solventler vb.</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Kalınlık</td><td width=\"329\">0.5 – 3 mm</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Standartlar</td><td width=\"329\">DIN / ISO / ASTM uyumlu üretim</td></tr></tbody></table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5ae9b4a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5ae9b4a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e1102e6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e1102e6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a57a3d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9a57a3d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4822de9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4822de9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Ürün Özellikleri</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-83a1617 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"83a1617\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>✔ <strong>Yüksek sıcaklık dayanımı</strong> – Buhar ve kızgın ortamlarda uygundur (geniş sıcaklık aralığında performans) <br />✔ <strong>Basınca karşı güçlü sızdırmazlık</strong> – Flanş, vana ve boru ek bağlantılarında etkin mühür oluşturur <br />✔ <strong>Kimyasal direnç</strong> – Yağ, asit, alkali çözeltiler ve solventlere karşı dirençlidir <br />✔ <strong>Esnek uyum</strong> – Yüzey düzensizliklerini doldurarak etkili conta performansı sağlar <br />✔ <strong>Asbestsiz üretim</strong> – Modern sızdırmazlık gereksinimlerine uygun, insan sağlığına zararsız alternatifler le üretilir</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f224b0a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f224b0a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2838448 elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-accordion\" data-id=\"2838448\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n        <div class=\"elementskit-accordion accoedion-primary\" id=\"accordion-6a2492107aef2\">\n\n            \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-0-2838448\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-d9bc4456a2492107aef2\" class=\"ekit-accordion--to